OL,3,GNEWSARecycling centre booking system
OL,4,Atrial set up
OL,5,
OL,6,FA booking system is being trialled at a
OL,7,Fcouncil's recycling centres in a bid to
OL,8,Favoid queues at peak times.
OL,10,FPlymouth City Council said evidence
OL,11,Ffrom similar schemes at other local
OL,12,Fauthorities had demonstrated "a range
OL,13,Fof operational benefits" including
OL,14,Fimproved traffic management and reduced
OL,15,Fqueueing.
OL,17,FIt is expected to be introduced at the
OL,18,Fcouncil's sites at Chelson Meadow and
OL,19,FWeston Mill with the trial set to cost
OL,20,F#26,000, the Local Democracy Reporting
OL,21,FService said.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
